WEBVTT

00:06.170 --> 00:07.790
The summer's almost over.

00:19.330 --> 00:22.250
So much happened on this break.

00:28.170 --> 00:29.040
Lieselotte.

00:42.290 --> 00:43.540
Y-Your Highness...?!

00:44.960 --> 00:45.710
Liese.

00:45.710 --> 00:46.920
Lieselotte.

00:46.920 --> 00:48.500
Lady Lieselotte...

00:48.670 --> 00:49.790
What's happening?!

00:50.000 --> 00:51.670
Lieselotte...

01:00.330 --> 01:03.710
That dream... What was that?

01:04.290 --> 01:06.290
I wonder what's wrong with Liese-tan?

01:06.420 --> 01:08.250
Maybe she had a nightmare...?

01:08.420 --> 01:12.420
<b>Riefenstahl Castle-Lieselotte's Room</b>

01:08.630 --> 01:12.420
<b>Lieselotte fell back asleep.</b>

01:08.670 --> 01:11.250
Oh. Looks like she went back to sleep, though.

01:11.250 --> 01:12.420
Oh, good!

01:12.880 --> 01:17.630
Please, let the new semester be a happy one
for Lieselotte and everyone!

01:18.210 --> 01:21.750
Ienai kimochi ni kizuite

01:21.750 --> 01:27.880
Ibitsu de bukiyou na kotoba de tsutaeru kara

01:28.130 --> 01:31.040
Kitto kimi ni

01:40.290 --> 01:43.250
Itsumo gomakashichau yo

01:43.250 --> 01:45.710
(Doki doki barenai youni)

01:45.790 --> 01:50.920
Zenbu mabushisugiru kimi no sei dayo

01:51.170 --> 01:53.960
Kawaiku nante narenaiyo

01:53.960 --> 01:55.710
(Datte niawanai desho?)

01:55.710 --> 01:58.540
Sono me ni utsuru sora mo

01:58.540 --> 02:01.830
Massugu mitsumerarenakute

02:01.830 --> 02:07.170
Uso darake no sekai ni itsumade iru no?

02:07.170 --> 02:12.080
Kono mamaja nanimo kaerarenai

02:12.250 --> 02:14.790
Sonna no iya dayo

02:14.790 --> 02:20.920
Moshimo kamisama ga kimochi tsugete kuretatoshitemo

02:20.920 --> 02:26.250
Itsuka jibun no koe de kimi no koto ga suki dato tsutaetai

02:26.500 --> 02:35.000
Moshimo ibitsudemo taisetsu na omoi dokoka kiechau mae ni

02:35.500 --> 02:38.210
Yuuki dasu kara

02:50.880 --> 02:51.460
Huh?

02:50.920 --> 02:54.830
<b>Chapter 6</b>

02:50.920 --> 02:54.830
<b>A Nightmare, the Coward, and the Princess Carry</b>

02:51.460 --> 02:52.920
Uh, what's going on?

02:53.250 --> 02:54.250
When did this happen?

02:54.250 --> 02:55.170
Why?

02:55.330 --> 02:59.210
Fiene, your walk has gotten much more refined.

02:59.210 --> 03:01.420
Thank you, dear sister.

03:01.630 --> 03:04.130
Now, you simply have to apply what you learned here.

03:04.290 --> 03:05.580
Oh, I see!

03:05.580 --> 03:07.830
Did you hear? Apparently it turns out they're cousins!

03:08.040 --> 03:09.080
Seriously?

03:09.380 --> 03:11.250
So Miss Fiene's a noble?

03:11.250 --> 03:12.710
I hear they're sisters now.

03:12.710 --> 03:14.710
What?! Wasn't she a commoner?

03:14.710 --> 03:17.380
They say she's living with Lady Lieselotte in her mansion!

03:17.380 --> 03:18.580
Really?!

03:22.540 --> 03:23.460
Lieselotte!

03:26.080 --> 03:27.580
Y-Your Highness!

03:28.210 --> 03:30.630
Here, look. It's the ribbon you gave me.

03:30.830 --> 03:32.130
I went ahead and tied it on.

03:35.670 --> 03:36.540
Your Highness!

03:36.830 --> 03:40.130
With all due respect, this is completely skewed.

03:40.130 --> 03:42.290
And the lengths aren't even, either.

03:42.290 --> 03:43.920
Not only does it look unfortunate,

03:43.920 --> 03:47.880
you do realize this will get in the way
when you perform magic?

03:48.210 --> 03:52.080
Ooh, she cut right to the chase!
A jet stream of Lieselotte's prickly words!

03:52.080 --> 03:54.210
But just look at Sieg and Fiene!

03:55.960 --> 03:57.330
Not offended in the slightest!

03:57.330 --> 03:59.790
They both see right through her act now!

03:59.790 --> 04:03.250
Really, Liese-tan is such a reliable tsundere. Adorable!

04:08.290 --> 04:10.130
Hmm, I wonder what the matter is.

04:10.290 --> 04:11.420
I'll go take a look.

04:12.710 --> 04:17.540
Well, I made a big fuss about it to you,
but apparently he doesn't care about me anymore.

04:19.330 --> 04:20.460
Fiene, dear.

04:20.460 --> 04:21.000
Hm?

04:21.000 --> 04:22.750
There's something I would like you to do for me.

04:23.040 --> 04:24.380
Something you want me to do?

04:24.380 --> 04:28.750
Exactly. Being the cute, obedient little sister that you are,
I'm sure you would do anything for me?

04:29.790 --> 04:31.630
Of course, Lieselotte!

04:33.460 --> 04:38.130
Baldur. Why have you yet to make
an advance on my adorable little sister?

04:38.880 --> 04:41.540
Miss Fiene is why you called me here?

04:41.750 --> 04:46.920
I hear before the summer, you voiced sweet words akin
to declarations of love with no reservations whatsoever.

04:47.630 --> 04:51.960
But since the start of the new semester, you've been
keeping your distance like a different person altogether.

04:51.960 --> 04:53.920
What could you possibly be waiting for?

04:54.210 --> 04:58.920
I heard from Uncle Bruno how Miss Fiene
was welcomed into House Riefenstahl.

04:59.250 --> 05:01.580
Also that I'm no longer the heir.

05:01.880 --> 05:05.790
I do feel guilty for making those decisions without you.

05:06.040 --> 05:07.500
That's not the issue.

05:07.920 --> 05:11.040
I agree that it was the best way to ensure her safety.

05:11.420 --> 05:15.790
Besides, I had no interest in inheriting the marquisate,
so I'm actually quite relieved.

05:16.250 --> 05:19.960
But if I declare my feelings for Miss Fiene now...

05:20.630 --> 05:23.830
...you will appear to be a man removed
from the line of succession,

05:23.830 --> 05:25.960
faking his love for the sake of title and prestige.

05:26.250 --> 05:29.080
You're worried that's what other people will think.

05:29.380 --> 05:31.710
I don't care what anyone else thinks.

05:31.710 --> 05:35.710
But I can't bear the thought of
Miss Fiene assuming that of me.

05:36.540 --> 05:38.540
She would look on me with contempt.

05:38.540 --> 05:43.750
Not only would she doubt my feelings for her, she would
lose faith in me, and perhaps shun me altogether.

05:44.000 --> 05:45.500
If such a thing were to happen...

05:46.380 --> 05:48.500
I...I...

05:57.040 --> 05:58.210
You coward!

06:00.830 --> 06:05.710
She would doubt your feelings for her? Then you should
grovel or whatever else it takes to make her believe you!

06:05.710 --> 06:10.630
Stop fretting over this like a fool. Cast aside your
inhibitions and shed some tears to beg for her love!

06:11.830 --> 06:14.670
Bal's totally getting slammed here.

06:14.670 --> 06:16.750
Liese-tan, take it easy on him!

06:16.750 --> 06:19.170
You've already crushed his spirit as it is!

06:19.380 --> 06:24.130
Seriously, you're so inanely stubborn.
Not honest with yourself at all.

06:24.540 --> 06:26.790
I don't want to hear that from you, Liese.

06:26.790 --> 06:28.080
Did I hear you say something?

06:28.080 --> 06:29.210
Uh... no.

06:29.830 --> 06:35.380
In any case, you have feelings for Fiene.
Am I not mistaken in that regard?

06:35.580 --> 06:37.790
Yes, you're perfectly right there.

06:37.960 --> 06:39.630
I can say with confidence that...

06:40.250 --> 06:41.380
...I love Miss Fiene.

06:46.130 --> 06:48.540
I shall leave the two of you to talk it out, then.

06:48.540 --> 06:50.420
"Two of" us? Hold on, Liese.

06:50.750 --> 06:51.710
What do you mean?

07:01.130 --> 07:01.960
Don't tell me...

07:12.420 --> 07:13.460
Miss Fiene!

07:14.750 --> 07:15.790
Did you hear everything?

07:16.130 --> 07:21.290
U-um, she told me to stay in here
w-without making a sound, so...

07:22.250 --> 07:23.630
That Liese...

07:29.420 --> 07:33.790
Please believe me, Miss Fiene.
I love you from the bottom of my heart.

07:34.210 --> 07:37.460
When I'm away from you,
that alone robs the world of its color,

07:37.460 --> 07:41.040
and simply being with you makes
the whole world beautiful.

07:41.040 --> 07:41.790
Uh...

07:41.790 --> 07:44.500
I would gladly lay down my life for the sake of your smile.

07:44.830 --> 07:47.580
How can I put these feeling into words?

07:47.880 --> 07:49.420
Stop. Hold on, please!

07:50.290 --> 07:53.920
How can you fire off such embarrassing things
one right after the other?

07:54.130 --> 07:58.670
When you're cornered and desperate, you have to forget
about protecting yourself and go for the attack instead!

07:58.670 --> 08:00.960
Don't go all battle mode on me!

08:01.040 --> 08:04.170
Please! I'm just that desperate for you!

08:04.170 --> 08:05.460
No, wait. Please don't!

08:05.750 --> 08:08.250
So you do hate me now, after all...

08:08.250 --> 08:12.790
That's not it! If I had to choose whether
I like you or hate you, well I... uh...

08:12.790 --> 08:13.460
But regardless!

08:15.750 --> 08:18.710
I've lived my entire life as a commoner.

08:19.000 --> 08:20.920
Even now, I'm a commoner inside.

08:20.920 --> 08:28.210
But if we were to... date or something, everyone will
assume I'm on track to become the future marquise.

08:28.790 --> 08:31.960
But that's different from an
ordinary relationship or marriage

08:31.960 --> 08:35.040
where you nurture love with someone special, you know?

08:35.040 --> 08:37.040
Man, I wish we could say something!

08:37.040 --> 08:41.080
And poor Fiene's still stuck in the back of the closet.
Let her come out already!

08:41.080 --> 08:41.500
Huh?

08:41.500 --> 08:44.750
When Sieg's not around we're really just spectators.

08:44.750 --> 08:48.000
Aww, if only Fiene could hear our voices!

08:48.000 --> 08:49.000
Yeah...

08:49.290 --> 08:51.670
Um? Those voices just now...

08:52.040 --> 08:52.790
"Voices"?

08:53.250 --> 08:56.750
Sir Bal can't hear them. Could this be-

08:59.670 --> 09:01.080
This light!

09:01.080 --> 09:04.250
Whoa! This is where Fiene awakens to her powers?!

09:04.250 --> 09:08.670
Fiene! If you can hear our voices
will you give a us a wink, please?

09:08.750 --> 09:10.500
Um, all right!

09:18.540 --> 09:20.580
S...so cute!

09:20.830 --> 09:24.130
Yup, she definitely hears us.

09:24.130 --> 09:26.040
Hey, Fiene. I'm Endo the running commentator.

09:26.040 --> 09:27.750
And I'm Kobayashi the expert analyst!

09:27.920 --> 09:32.290
No need to respond! Just listening to what
we say is the right way to get the most out of us!

09:32.290 --> 09:35.330
Are these the Voices of the Gods
that His Highness spoke of?

09:35.330 --> 09:36.130
Fiene?

09:36.130 --> 09:36.880
Yes?

09:37.250 --> 09:41.960
You heard what Bal said,
that he's not interested in leading his house.

09:42.130 --> 09:46.540
If you tell him you don't want to be marquise,
he'd gladly elope with you.

09:48.170 --> 09:49.790
Go ahead, Fiene.

09:51.040 --> 10:00.750
Sir Bal, if... just if, I said I like you but I don't want
to become marquise, what would you do?

10:03.790 --> 10:07.670
I would take you and flee the kingdom together.

10:08.710 --> 10:11.630
Fortunately, both you and I are skilled in combat.

10:11.630 --> 10:13.420
I'm sure we could make a living anywhere we go,

10:13.830 --> 10:17.460
and I promise you that I'll do everything within
my power to ensure your life is free of strife.

10:17.540 --> 10:24.250
Most importantly, your smile is all
I need to be happy, Miss Fiene.

10:26.330 --> 10:29.580
I can't believe you can say all that... with a straight face.

10:31.670 --> 10:36.500
All right. For starters, let's worry
about marriage and all that later.

10:36.500 --> 10:39.670
For now, if it's an offer of courtship, Sir Bal...

10:46.130 --> 10:47.290
...I accept.

10:48.540 --> 10:49.880
Miss Fiene!

10:53.080 --> 10:56.080
Yesssss!

10:57.580 --> 10:59.960
Good work, Bal! You're a coward no more!

10:59.960 --> 11:01.880
That made my heart pound, too!

11:01.880 --> 11:05.960
Hey, so Fiene and Baldur are going out now,
and Sieg and Liese-tan are doing so well.

11:06.290 --> 11:10.170
We're getting closer to the best happy end
to end all happy ends, aren't we?

11:10.170 --> 11:11.960
Yeah! I'm sure of it!

11:13.960 --> 11:18.290
Oh jeez, don't tell me you're blushing now!

11:18.290 --> 11:20.920
Uh, well... I couldn't help it.

11:22.420 --> 11:25.040
Honestly, what would they have done without me?

11:30.830 --> 11:31.630
What's this?!

11:35.000 --> 11:37.630
Now that wretched rival is out of the way.

11:38.170 --> 11:39.380
"Rival"?

11:42.210 --> 11:47.630
Now that the girl is the daughter of a marquis,
she's the most likely to take His Highness from you.

11:47.630 --> 11:49.580
You're wrong! She would never-!

11:49.580 --> 11:52.670
You fool. She would steal His Highness away.

11:52.670 --> 11:54.790
Stop! Stop it, stop it!

11:55.040 --> 11:57.420
Stop it!

12:02.540 --> 12:04.960
I really do love this ribbon.

12:05.250 --> 12:08.000
I-it's really nothing much to speak of.

12:09.540 --> 12:11.710
Why must I always respond like this?

12:11.710 --> 12:14.000
I do nothing but brush off His Highness' intentions.

12:22.630 --> 12:25.710
I've put up with you long enough.

12:26.960 --> 12:27.710
Wait!

12:28.000 --> 12:31.330
Please don't go, Your Highness!

12:35.920 --> 12:38.330
I loathe her. I loathe her...

12:38.330 --> 12:40.630
I loathe that girl so much!

12:59.670 --> 13:01.040
Lieselotte...

13:01.790 --> 13:02.290
Hmm?

13:03.500 --> 13:04.210
Ah!

13:04.830 --> 13:06.000
Lieselotte-

13:07.040 --> 13:08.790
Lieselotte, listen-

13:09.000 --> 13:09.830
Huh?

13:10.330 --> 13:11.830
Lieselotte, um...

13:14.420 --> 13:15.170
Lieselotte?

13:15.750 --> 13:17.040
Lieselotte.

13:17.960 --> 13:19.130
Lieselotte!

13:21.080 --> 13:24.670
Did I do something to make her hate me?

13:24.960 --> 13:25.880
Lieselotte!

13:26.420 --> 13:27.250
Hm?

13:27.880 --> 13:29.330
I got a hold of you at last!

13:29.330 --> 13:30.630
I wish to have a word with you.

13:31.460 --> 13:33.080
What's going on with you?

13:33.420 --> 13:34.710
Nothing is going on.

13:34.710 --> 13:36.000
Don't play dumb with me!

13:36.330 --> 13:41.130
I know that you've been plagued with nightmares
and you wake up crying every night!

13:41.540 --> 13:43.250
There's no point in hiding it.

13:43.460 --> 13:48.170
Miss Fiene awakened to her powers just the other day
and can now hear the Voices of the Gods.

13:48.460 --> 13:49.330
"Awakened"?

13:49.330 --> 13:54.630
Your nights have been miserable. And yet you keep
attending the academy as if nothing is wrong.

13:57.920 --> 14:00.130
So that's what's been going on with Lieselotte?

14:00.380 --> 14:03.500
I hear you've even been avoiding His Highness lately.

14:04.460 --> 14:08.790
We're all worried about you.
Both of us, and His Highness too!

14:08.790 --> 14:10.000
That can't be right!

14:10.500 --> 14:13.880
His Highness thinks absolutely nothing of me!

14:15.710 --> 14:18.630
I know. I know I'm not like you.

14:19.000 --> 14:21.540
I'm nowhere near as candid or endearing as you.

14:23.210 --> 14:24.330
Lieselotte...

14:31.290 --> 14:37.130
I'm far too stubborn and unlovable to hope
that His Highness might care about me!

14:37.380 --> 14:40.330
Lord Endoh, Lady Kobayashee,
why do you remain silent?

14:40.330 --> 14:43.290
Sorry, we can't tell you anything right now.

14:43.750 --> 14:47.880
Sieg, please have faith in what
we've told you about Liese-tan so far,

14:47.880 --> 14:51.210
and what you've seen about her for yourself.

14:51.210 --> 14:53.920
Believe in your actual feelings for her

14:54.460 --> 14:57.630
My..."actual feelings"?

15:06.000 --> 15:07.040
Lieselotte!

15:10.790 --> 15:12.000
Lieselotte!

15:15.830 --> 15:18.250
Why would you ever think I don't care about you?

15:18.460 --> 15:24.500
I apologize if I made you feel lonely.
If you're troubled by something-

15:24.500 --> 15:25.710
Please, no more!

15:26.460 --> 15:29.170
I beseech you, don't say anymore...

15:33.000 --> 15:34.130
What can I do?

15:36.880 --> 15:38.500
If I can't get through to her with words...

15:43.630 --> 15:45.380
Y-Your Highness...

16:09.170 --> 16:10.210
Lieselotte!

16:10.830 --> 16:12.080
Lieselotte!

16:18.380 --> 16:26.710
Lieselotte. This is Crown Prince Siegwald,
your future fiancé.

16:30.380 --> 16:31.880
A... prince!

16:33.750 --> 16:35.330
Hey, let's go play together!

16:40.710 --> 16:45.580
That was the moment I fell in love.

16:48.170 --> 16:51.960
Father, I love Prince Siegwald so much!

16:52.420 --> 16:53.380
Is that so.

16:53.380 --> 16:56.330
I want His Highness will fall in love with me, too.

16:56.540 --> 17:01.130
And then we'll have a wedding
and live happily ever after!

17:03.080 --> 17:07.670
Listen, Lieselotte. That's not something
you can ever tell His Highness.

17:08.130 --> 17:09.080
Why not?

17:09.080 --> 17:12.170
His Highness will one day become king of this land.

17:12.750 --> 17:18.080
He is no position to voice his like or dislike
of any individual so irresponsibly.

17:18.080 --> 17:18.830
Huh?

17:19.170 --> 17:22.170
While you may be his fiancée,
you are still one of his subjects.

17:22.670 --> 17:25.330
You must never impose on His Highness.

17:28.420 --> 17:31.960
And so I obeyed my father's words.

17:32.920 --> 17:37.330
Lieselotte! I just found some flowers over there
that have a similar color to your eyes!

17:39.670 --> 17:40.250
Huh?

17:40.330 --> 17:40.960
I...

17:41.380 --> 17:46.830
I do not like you in the slightest, Your Highness!

17:49.210 --> 17:52.380
From then on, I desperately put a lid on my feelings.

17:52.750 --> 17:54.580
It hurt. How it hurt.

17:54.920 --> 17:57.080
In truth, I loved him more than anyone else.

17:57.420 --> 18:00.500
But I didn't want to burden His Highness.

18:01.670 --> 18:06.630
Once I entered the academy, I was elated
to be able to spend more time with him.

18:07.000 --> 18:08.830
Nothing could have made me happier.

18:09.920 --> 18:10.790
And yet...

18:21.130 --> 18:24.330
Why? No... No...

18:24.710 --> 18:25.880
Don't hate me.

18:26.130 --> 18:29.080
I love you. Don't look at anyone else.

18:29.580 --> 18:31.250
I loathe... I loathe her!

18:45.130 --> 18:46.080
You can do this!

18:46.250 --> 18:47.580
Don't give in!

18:51.670 --> 18:54.960
Come on, Lieselotte!
Don't give in to the stupid Witch of Yore!

18:55.170 --> 18:57.500
Liese-tan! Stay strong!

18:57.710 --> 18:59.920
I swear we'll never, ever, ever, let you die.

18:59.920 --> 19:03.920
We're gonna work with Sieg to make sure
you get the happiness you deserve!

19:04.500 --> 19:09.710
What heartwarming voices.
I feel like they're protecting me from afar.

19:10.750 --> 19:13.130
...lotte! Lieselotte!

19:13.920 --> 19:15.040
Lieselotte!

19:15.040 --> 19:17.460
Oh, I know this voice...

19:17.960 --> 19:19.330
Lieselotte!

19:22.080 --> 19:22.790
Your Highness...

19:25.500 --> 19:26.460
Lieselotte!

19:27.500 --> 19:29.580
Don't worry, her heart rate's calming down.

19:29.920 --> 19:33.670
Thanks to Fiene's healing spell,
her face is looking much less pale.

19:33.670 --> 19:34.710
She'll be fine.

19:35.080 --> 19:37.080
Oh, Lieselotte. Thank goodness!

19:38.290 --> 19:39.170
Thank you.

19:39.580 --> 19:45.460
Lord Endoh, Lady Kobayashee. I heard you mention
earlier not to give in to the Witch of Yore.

19:45.460 --> 19:46.330
We did.

19:46.500 --> 19:51.670
The witch is currently draining Lieselotte's psyche
in an attempt to take over her body.

19:51.920 --> 19:52.540
What?

19:53.040 --> 19:56.040
If the witch's manipulation manages to break her heart,

19:56.250 --> 20:00.880
the possessed Lieselotte will transform
into a gruesome monster.

20:01.080 --> 20:04.710
And then she will attempt to take Fiene's life.

20:07.630 --> 20:09.880
Once she eliminates Fiene she'll destroy the kingdom.

20:10.250 --> 20:13.290
After the kingdom, she'll lay waste to the world itself.

20:13.630 --> 20:18.630
In order to stop the destruction,
you'll have no choice but to take Lieselotte's life.

20:19.000 --> 20:20.330
Her life...?

20:20.540 --> 20:24.380
But the key to preventing this tragedy lies with you, Sieg.

20:24.380 --> 20:25.380
Me?

20:25.670 --> 20:29.710
That means what you do determines
whether Lieselotte's heart breaks or not.

20:29.710 --> 20:30.790
Yeah.

20:31.000 --> 20:35.880
Because Lieselotte loves you Sieg,
from the very bottom of her heart.

20:36.290 --> 20:43.250
So even if her heart is about to succumb
to the Witch of Yore, as long as I hold her dear...

20:43.250 --> 20:49.420
Right. As long as you don't reject her she'll be fine.
I'm sure you'll be able to prevent her heart from breaking.

20:50.290 --> 20:55.040
You mean to say... her love for me runs that deep?

20:55.040 --> 20:58.580
Sorry, I wish we could have told you earlier.

20:59.000 --> 21:03.460
But pretending to love her out of obligation
or duty won't change the future.

21:03.670 --> 21:05.540
That's why we couldn't just say,

21:05.830 --> 21:09.750
"Fall in love with Lieselotte to save
the world from destruction," y'know?

21:10.000 --> 21:13.580
We had to wait until you developed
those feelings on your own.

21:14.580 --> 21:16.830
But you do feel that way now, don't you?

21:16.830 --> 21:18.750
You've figured it out, right?

21:26.580 --> 21:27.580
Yes.

21:34.670 --> 21:36.460
I will escort her home.

21:36.460 --> 21:37.580
Oh, all right!

21:37.580 --> 21:39.960
Hold on, I'll get a carriage prepared right away.

21:39.960 --> 21:41.040
Come help me!

21:41.040 --> 21:41.710
Sure!

21:42.330 --> 21:48.630
Lieselotte, no matter what happens,
I will always be by your side.

21:51.380 --> 21:54.250
A princess carry is too much for me to take!

21:54.250 --> 21:55.710
Calm down, Kobayashi!

21:55.710 --> 21:56.210
Huh?

21:56.670 --> 21:59.880
Lieselotte's still unconscious, but she has a little smile!

21:59.880 --> 22:02.540
And now she's leaning into Sieg
and nuzzling against him!

22:02.540 --> 22:03.580
Aghhh!

22:03.580 --> 22:08.380
I can't, I just can't! Only Liese-tan could pull
a killer move like that when she's not even conscious!

22:09.210 --> 22:11.750
I think I'm about to pass out, too...

22:14.170 --> 22:16.130
I have been enlightened thanks to the gods.

22:16.420 --> 22:19.830
How Lieselotte is a tsun de rais,
and about my own feelings as well.

22:20.290 --> 22:24.460
I realize now... how dear she is to me.

22:27.040 --> 22:31.750
And so, the prince and princess lived happily ever after.

22:43.670 --> 22:49.630
Kurushiku kanjiru hodo mabushii hohoemi o

22:49.630 --> 22:55.290
Imadani massugu mirenai watashi

22:55.750 --> 23:01.880
Kokoro no fukaku de chirabatta kimochi o

23:01.880 --> 23:07.540
Yukkuri atsumete yuku youni

23:08.500 --> 23:14.250
Yozora no hoshi ga subete o

23:15.250 --> 23:20.330
Miteruno? Shitteiruno?

23:21.420 --> 23:26.960
Mado o akete toikakeru

23:27.580 --> 23:30.960
Doushite?

23:32.750 --> 23:38.920
Kono sekai wa kagayaki de michiteiru

23:39.040 --> 23:45.040
Anata no egao ga oshiete kureta

23:45.040 --> 23:51.040
Shiawase na ketsumatsu o negatte shimau no

23:51.420 --> 24:01.250
Anata no soba ni ireta nara

24:01.250 --> 24:03.080
Itsumademo

24:07.460 --> 24:09.420
Itsumademo

24:13.790 --> 24:14.960
Good for you, Baldur!

24:15.170 --> 24:17.330
Yes, it finally worked out with Miss Fiene.

24:17.460 --> 24:19.960
You know, I actually have my heart set on someone, too.

24:20.250 --> 24:20.830
What?

24:20.830 --> 24:21.830
Just kidding!

24:22.130 --> 24:24.670
Next Episode: The Prophesy, the Little Boy,
and the Live Broadcast.

24:24.670 --> 24:26.040
Who? Who is it?!

24:24.960 --> 24:27.960
<b>The Prophesy, the Little Boy, and the Live Broadcast</b>

24:26.040 --> 24:27.000
That's a secret!
